  "title": "· New Bags | Bottega Veneta Presents Spring/Summer 2027 Runway: Featherweight Weaves ·",
  "original_title": "新包 | Bottega Veneta 发布2027春夏时装秀：轻盈编织",
  "excerpt": "Bottega Veneta's Spring/Summer 2027 Milan show blends its signature Intrecciato weave with lighter materials like lace and knit.",
