      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "The Bottega Veneta Spring/Summer 2027 runway show has just wrapped in Milan. This season's collection draws inspiration from the shifting seasons of Milan, with creative director Louise Trotter starting from the concept of \"lightening\" to fuse the house's signature Intrecciato weaving technique with lace, crochet, fringe, knit, and other diverse materials, leaving breathing room between the garment and the body and letting the classic woven texture unfurl freely in a lighter register.",
      "url": null,
      "full_url": null,
      "alt": null,
      "columns": 2,
      "items": []
