    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "The pillow clutch is woven from lightweight fabric, its airy large checks adding a sense of breathability to the classic weave. The Lauren 1980 clutch cleverly combines leather with printed fabric, injecting a vacation spirit into a vintage silhouette. The basket bag is trimmed with frayed leather-strip edges, revealing an unfinished wabi-sabi beauty.",
      "url": null,
      "full_url": null,
      "alt": null,
      "columns": 2,
      "items": []
