    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "The flap bag condenses the checkered texture of the Intrecciato weave onto a metal square buckle, paired with lizard skin, woven leather, solid leather, and other materials across clean constructions, continuing the understated, logo-free ethos.",
