    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "The drawstring bag takes its cue from the dust bag, its supple leather casually clutched in the hand and naturally creased, accented with slender drawstring fringes and tasseled leather knots. Soft tones of off-white, cream yellow, light khaki, and grass green render a light, relaxed spring/summer mood.",
